 database. For our voting system, we want to store two kinds of entities in the database.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/2d6118544140881e9d0d096d7c7639b7?_a=AQADKdt","num_upvotes":5,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-06-21T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"zJ7g03PQf","title":"Streamline Your API Development With Neo4j GraphQL, and StepZen","url":"https://stepzen.com/blog/neo4j-stepzen-fast-api-development-graph-db","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/streamline-your-api-development-with-neo4j-graphql-and-stepzen-zj7g03pqf","summary":"StepZen is a tool that allows developers to quickly and easily create GraphQL APIs that leverage data from multiple sources. Neo4j provides a GraphQL API library which is powerful because GraphQL can be mapped so neatly onto a graph database, and a graph Database maps onto GraphQL nicely when they\u2019re both implemented as graphs.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/f9130afd7556e673bbfb0a726f99526d?_a=AQADKdt","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-06-05T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"S2rcbwLPM","title":"Measure GraphQL API Performance in the Dashboard","url":"https://stepzen.com/blog/measure-graphql-api-performance-dashboard","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/measure-graphql-api-performance-in-the-dashboard-s2rcbwlpm","summary":"Measure GraphQL API Performance in the Dashboard is available on the StepZen Dashboard. For all your endpoints we provide three different metrics for each endpoint that will help you to review and analyze its performance.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/a5b68170e3d444c5e0f344cb21227d49?_a=AQADKdt","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-04-25T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"iSbfyCTvE","title":"Getting Started with Snowflake and GraphQL","url":"https://stepzen.com/blog/getting-started-with-snowflake","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/getting-started-with-snowflake-and-graphql-isbfyctve","summary":"StepZen is a cloud-based data warehousing company that provides a platform for storing, managing, and analyzing large amounts of data. Getting Started with Snowflake and GraphQL Snowflake will help us get started with the GraphQL journey. StepZen is continuously providing more data sources for the getting started experience.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/805035950d68cd2e8d6af39dcd382c6d","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-04-10T11:46:50.298Z"},{"id":"BzSjl9ga8","title":"Handbook for using fragments in GraphQL","url":"https://stepzen.com/blog/using-graphql-fragments-for-unions-interfaces","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/handbook-for-using-fragments-in-graphql-bzsjl9ga8","summary":"Learn how to use GraphQL fragments to construct operations that return data from GraphQL unions and interfaces.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/54491b9277f2a9c4b8bbcad49a26025b?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-04-03T10:27:59.426Z"},{"id":"rl7EJRWdF","title":"Transforming REST APIs with 'jq' in GraphQL","url":"https://stepzen.com/blog/transforming-rest-apis-with-jq-in-graphql","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/transforming-rest-apis-with-jq-in-graphql-rl7ejrwdf","summary":"Learn how to use StepZen and jq to transform REST API JSON responses into a GraphQL API in a declarative way.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/54491b9277f2a9c4b8bbcad49a26025b?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-03-23T18:41:23.551Z"},{"id":"LF2ga8kMF","title":"Build Angular search functionality with GraphQL","url":"https://stepzen.com/blog/getting-started-with-graphql-in-angular","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/build-angular-search-functionality-with-graphql-lf2ga8kmf","summary":"Learn how to build an Angular application that uses GraphQL to fetch data from a server. The tutorial covers setting up a new Angular project, creating a GraphQL API with IBM StepZen, adding Apollo Client to the Angular application, fetching data with Apollo Client, and adding search functionality.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/54491b9277f2a9c4b8bbcad49a26025b?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-03-15T11:59:15.587Z"},{"id":"IJlOPiAVB","title":"Build GraphQL APIs On Your Data In Under 5 Minutes","url":"https://stepzen.com/blog/introducing-new-getting-started-experience-stepzen-dashboard","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/build-graphql-apis-on-your-data-in-under-5-minutes-ijlopiavb","summary":"Easily build GraphQL APIs on any data source in under 5 minutes with StepZen's new Getting Started experience. Visually configure your data source, generate CLI commands, and explore your GraphQL API in the StepZen dashboard.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/2650f9a204fb4f1f165ed299590a38a6?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-03-07T20:31:09.443Z"},{"id":"A1Aim4Nmc","title":"Data modeling in GraphQL for extending and combining types","url":"https://stepzen.com/blog/handling-different-reponse-formats-with-union-types-in-graphql","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/data-modeling-in-graphql-for-extending-and-combining-types-a1aim4nmc","summary":"Learn how to model and combine data in GraphQL using type extensions and union types.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/54491b9277f2a9c4b8bbcad49a26025b?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-02-21T11:47:49.972Z"},{"id":"AtviXI4NT","title":"StepZen is acquired by IBM","url":"https://stepzen.com/blog/stepzen-acquired-by-ibm","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/stepzen-is-acquired-by-ibm-atvixi4nt","summary":"StepZen has been acquired by IBM, with a focus on expanding the G